hide footbox
autonumber
title SB-M03 — Independent link disable and fresh access
actor Owner as U
participant "Protected employer link" as L
actor "Fresh viewer context" as V
U -> L : Explicitly disable this link
L -> L : Check current owner-control authority
alt Denied or failed / unconfirmed change
 L --> U : Actual denial/failure; not disabled-success
else Effective disablement confirmed
 L --> U : Link disabled
 V -> L : Request new protected access
 L -> L : Evaluate current disabled state
 L --> V : Deny new page / file / PDF access
end
note over U,V
No PDF settings change is required or caused.
Existing-session/in-flight timing is not decided here.
end note
legend bottom
Logical domain interaction, not runtime execution evidence.
Detailed proposed guards/policies retain their primary status.
endlegend
